{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120168","id":3842788198,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7lDEtm","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120168","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120168.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120168.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120168","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120168/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120168/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120168/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8629575f1bdb4644fabb3e7a21c10261fb42873b","number":120168,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Expose `get_stream_name` in `AudioStream`","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo","html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86935\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nAs mentioned in the issue `AudioStream._get_stream_name()` (virtual) is exposed, but `AudioStream.get_stream_name()` is not.\r\nThe method has no real uses in the engine (aside from a test), but names for each stream were already defined. This PR, aside from exposing the method, also changes the defined names to make them more consistent and expected.\r\nThere might be some niche uses for this method, but I can see it being much more useful if a `set_stream_name()` method exists. I could either add that to this PR or another one, if it's a good idea.\r\n\r\nI also wonder if the names should be just the last part of the entire class name, or just the class name: `\"Randomizer\"` vs `\"AudioStreamRandomizer\"`.\r\n\r\n`audio_stream.cpp` also has an outdated comment inside `AudioStreamMicrophone::get_stream_name()`. I could clean that up for this PR since it's related, but since I didn't directly touch that specific method, I thought I should leave it alone until I'm given the green light. ([line](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3df26a02c446710c979daa541b74f87edeca81b0/servers/audio/audio_stream.cpp#L371))","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/